# Review of graph/3.9.kg (the machine-code emitters written in the old body's own language) by r3/review-in-language-emitter. Every cited file was opened at its lines at commit b8ff978c9; the old runtime was not run. The study's probe directory was still present in the session scratchpad and was read; its 251-byte object was relinked and run.

n: 9.5.14
kind: hub
name: review-of-in-language-emitter
is: 38 claims of 3.9 (25 observations, 13 findings, none relayed) were read against the old body's files, five working notes, the study report and the study's probe: 31 confirmed, 7 hold only as amended, 0 disputed, 0 left unreviewed. Amended: a heat count for the leaf compiler the study did not see (jit-heat-gate.fk), an if that does call a helper, a fourth whole-defn decline, a capacity counted as an address, one fixup the page emitter has, a rule about heat-mark faults the open fault does not yet support, and an 80-line probe called about 100.
at: 2026-11-24
by: r3/review-in-language-emitter

