is: Line counts re-run with wc: 396, 306, 678, 138, 74, 401, and 799 for the unopened bml-demand-jit.bml. form-lower.fk:28 imports form-asm.fk and sha256-arm64-jit.fk:14 does too. Not named by the node: hand-written x86-64 byte images for Linux (body-fingerprint.bml:20-27 and the 44-line bml/native-linux.bml) also go through the CPU image door.
