n: 9.5.14.2
kind: review
re: 3.9.1.2
saw: 315033f3
ack: node
is: True of the runtime's heat pulse only (fkwu-uni.c:24350, 24094). The leaf compiler has a heat count of its own in Form, unopened by the study: form-stdlib/jit-heat-gate.fk (101 lines; 16-21, 65-78) counts requests per program identity, compiles once through jit-once-born.fk (lines 98, 109) when a lowerable program's count reaches 5 (jit-decision.fk:14-15) and releases a cooled image (79-92; jit-once-born.fk:133). A program reaches it only by calling the gate (form-cli-jit.bml:49-56). The 380, the 1024 and the tag-194 skip are confirmed; a bound page wears tag 194 too (fkwu-uni.c:10518).
by: r3/review-in-language-emitter
at: 2026-11-24

n: 9.5.14.3
