is: The tag 146 arm (fkwu-uni.c:22451-22458) passes the image to fk_jit_leaf_inram with no gate; the raw-image path is lines 5385-5447 and the byte check lines 5269-5289. jit_cpu_run also requires the image length to be a multiple of 4 (line 10883).
