n: 9.5.14.4
kind: review
re: 3.9.2.1
saw: d047ea37
ack: node
is: An if is not free of helper calls: words 0 and 2 are read in place and any other condition word calls the truth helper, table word 3 (jit-page.bml:191-205, jp-call(3) at line 200). The guard of the one-operand bnot_u32 is tbnz alone, with no orr (line 237). An eq with a nil side is answered in page words and does not call the op's helper (line 263). The rest is as the lines show: literals below 2^61 in magnitude (line 122), nil as movz x0,#1 (line 137), the pinned string word (140-143), reads, let, do, and the int paths of the fifteen binary ops (line 257).
by: r3/review-in-language-emitter
at: 2026-11-24

