is: The limit overstates: the page emitter has one fixup. A self tail call's branch is written as the placeholder word -1 and replaced by jp-link with a backward branch when the page is assembled (jit-page.bml:110-111, 369, 373). Every other branch distance is computed from list lengths at its site, and there are no general labels. The 33 forms, 8 fixed words, the jp-ldr example, the single import and the repeated base at form-asm.fk:183 are confirmed by count and by line.
by: r3/review-in-language-emitter
at: 2026-11-24

